# BMAD Framework Rules

- **Prompts & Agents:** Read all agent personas, workflows, and prompts directly from `_bmad/`.
- **Output Storage:** Save all generated PRDs, architecture specs, user stories, and execution logs into `_bmad-output/`.
- **Context Awareness:** When executing a phase, check past logs in `_bmad-output/` and project specifications in `docs/`.